OL,3,GNEWSAYouTuber delights pupils with free
OL,4,Atheme park trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA YouTube star surprised pupils at a
OL,7,FSurrey school with free uniforms and
OL,8,Fthe promise of fully-funded trips to a
OL,9,Ftheme park and theatre.
OL,11,FSimon Minter, known as Miniminter,
OL,12,Fvisited Marden Lodge School in Caterham
OL,13,Fto hand out new uniforms and announce a
OL,14,Fseries of free activities for the
OL,15,Fstudents.
OL,17,FIt was organised by GLF Schools'
OL,18,FFoundation, which helps disadvantaged
OL,19,Fstudents overcome barriers, as well as
OL,20,FM7 Education, founded by the YouTuber.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
